}
},
"autoHeight": true,
"components": ["2d1e3aaa-d1a3-4565-a540-c0fb9853e2cf"],
"content": "<p>I think you're just nostalgic of the good old days.</p>",
"height": 304.0,
"outputs": ["cc30749d-68c5-48f5-bc6b-51bec420bdc0"],
"theme": "default",
"title": "<p>Just nostalgic</p>",
