"1d9ba566-09f4-46e1-b461-6b02b9774d6f": {
"autoHeight": true,
"components": [],
"content": "<p>You can experiment by changing dialogues in the Arcweave project and see the changes reflected in the Godot project.</p><p>There are two ways to do this.</p>",
"height": 197.0,
"outputs": ["65d3312e-0657-42e8-8316-feaf1256ce62", "107e34ff-4019-4b7d-8828-1843a648aca0"],
"theme": "pink",
"title": "<p>Making changes</p>",
"width": 301.0,
"x": 10200.0,
"y": 11260.0
},
"1dd1f505-3681-49c8-a83e-998f2545ba6c": {
"assets": {
"cover": {
"id": "9cfd36f5-8981-4bc2-b576-49806f16f7ce"
}
},
"autoHeight": true,
"components": ["2d1e3aaa-d1a3-4565-a540-c0fb9853e2cf"],
"content": "<p>Did you know I used to write in most of them?</p>",
"height": 303.0,
"outputs": ["406eb633-0dae-41de-9086-961e1e14f9f1", "b6334330-9133-43ab-b362-b45617f12e0e", "b902d66f-704b-4f77-8612-b8bbc0b57b2b"],
"theme": "default",
"title": null,
"width": 301.0,
"x": 3140.0,
"y": 8480.0
},
"1f82a775-485a-44e1-97cb-e37d01c151e8": {
"assets": {
"cover": {
"id": "9cfd36f5-8981-4bc2-b576-49806f16f7ce"
}
},
"autoHeight": true,
"components": ["2d1e3aaa-d1a3-4565-a540-c0fb9853e2cf"],
"content": "<p>Why are you procrastinating?</p>",
"height": 284.0,
"outputs": ["46339467-6cc0-4afc-bf29-9bc66278afa4", "a6296c2c-6130-4601-9095-4c4a2b1afc77", "aebb2211-e171-42b3-a180-f852d393bb11", "684e00a8-f3a0-4f3f-b239-859621acedc1"],
"theme": "default",
"title": "<p>Why</p>",
"width": 301.0,
"x": 5700.0,
"y": 3940.0
},
"203d1b15-84f2-452c-b8aa-996798df4cd2": {
"assets": {
"cover": {
"id": "9cfd36f5-8981-4bc2-b576-49806f16f7ce"
}
},
"autoHeight": true,
"components": ["2d1e3aaa-d1a3-4565-a540-c0fb9853e2cf"],
"content": "<p>We always suffer when we don't listen to our inner child.</p>",
"height": 303.0,
"outputs": ["15230167-65f8-41db-9324-cc25f7ce39c6"],
"theme": "default",
"title": null,
"width": 301.0,
"x": 3840.0,
"y": 4540.0
},
"20ba7f6e-ba9b-4bf6-bc04-15f5c7f9ddb6": {
"assets": {
"cover": {
"id": "9cfd36f5-8981-4bc2-b576-49806f16f7ce"
}
},
"autoHeight": true,
"components": ["2cc43715-13b0-4cad-92d7-5b4f61fe66a7"],
"content": "<p>I live my life light as a feather. Free as a bird I am.</p>",
"height": 303.0,
"outputs": ["249363b2-941c-459c-8445-13cd7c0b1a53"],
"theme": "default",
"title": null,
"width": 301.0,
"x": 5300.0,
"y": 7280.0
},
