}
},
"components": ["2d1e3aaa-d1a3-4565-a540-c0fb9853e2cf"],
"content": "<p>Forgive your past self. And ask your inner child to forgive you.</p><pre><code>regrets -= 1</code></pre>",
"height": 401.0,
"outputs": ["4b682093-f908-429a-983a-2cbf1f9bdc0a"],
"theme": "default",
"title": "<p>You need to let go ( <span class=\"mention mention-component\" data-id=\"033582a9-c2ea-4fb5-97d9-f252d1303850\" data-type=\"component\" data-label=\"adventure game scripts\">adventure game scripts</span>  )</p>",
"width": 301.0,
"x": 4620.0,
"y": 4480.0
},
"442f8c93-fae1-469d-b1e9-a0c79fc4c4cf": {
"assets": {
"cover": {
"id": "9cfd36f5-8981-4bc2-b576-49806f16f7ce"
}
},
"autoHeight": true,
"components": ["2d1e3aaa-d1a3-4565-a540-c0fb9853e2cf"],
"content": "<p>My name is Andreas.</p>",
"height": 283.0,
