}
},
"autoHeight": true,
"components": [],
"content": "<p>To see the <strong>Arcweave web API</strong> in action, make changes to this project and sync them with the Godot game, with the click of a button.</p><p>Paste your API key and Project Hash into the plugin's fields and click <strong>Refresh Project</strong>.</p><p>After the data transfer is complete, you can run the game.</p>",
"height": 452.0,
"outputs": ["ed233600-fed1-40e5-be02-e9c2fe64391b", "a6a05316-23bc-40a6-9191-b6a12074a1dc", "b2b2c8b4-55c6-4050-a8e6-d0eea8e44679", "9aff198f-9d7d-47cf-8498-3080028c79d4"],
"theme": "cyan",
"title": "<p>Sync over Web API</p>",
"width": 381.0,
"x": 10380.0,
"y": 11540.0
},
