}
},
"components": ["2d1e3aaa-d1a3-4565-a540-c0fb9853e2cf"],
"content": "<p>Then your future self can thank your past self and your inner child can thank you.</p>",
"height": 401.0,
"outputs": ["b8385be7-86f0-40d8-bda1-af36f1586b99"],
"theme": "default",
"title": null,
"width": 301.0,
