}
},
"components": ["2d1e3aaa-d1a3-4565-a540-c0fb9853e2cf"],
"content": "<p>Then, you can forgive your inner child, and the inner child forgives your past self.</p>",
"height": 401.0,
"outputs": ["400656be-30e8-4a8b-8b63-d8e99ef25389"],
"theme": "default",
"title": null,
"width": 301.0,
