},
"a64b3600-c280-491c-8c12-e619f3fd25af": {
"assets": {
"cover": {
"id": "9cfd36f5-8981-4bc2-b576-49806f16f7ce"
}
},
"autoHeight": true,
"components": ["2cc43715-13b0-4cad-92d7-5b4f61fe66a7"],
"content": "<p>I would write my stories on it.</p>",
"height": 284.0,
"outputs": ["2ce77c6e-0b92-4ad4-96ad-9fdc23c74d8a"],
"theme": "default",
"title": "<p>I would write my stories on it.</p>",
"width": 301.0,
"x": 6940.0,
"y": 3360.0
},
"a6dace93-3d51-480a-9be5-7e0c7025d6ec": {
"assets": {
"cover": {
"id": "021fa9d6-8342-475a-b53a-9a465de67a25"
}
},
"autoHeight": true,
"components": ["2cc43715-13b0-4cad-92d7-5b4f61fe66a7", "ce5d1948-6893-44ef-845c-e81c48926efc", "033582a9-c2ea-4fb5-97d9-f252d1303850", "f5297f72-36ac-4047-8236-dd23d1da3de3"],
"content": "<p>Taken.</p><pre><code>if i_gameScripts < 2</code></pre><pre><code>i_gameScripts = 2</code></pre><pre><code>endif</code></pre>",
"height": 582.0,
"outputs": ["b0b8c369-2458-4a02-b642-bf65c43960ca"],
"theme": "lightBlue",
"title": "<p>Take <span class=\"mention mention-component\" data-id=\"033582a9-c2ea-4fb5-97d9-f252d1303850\" data-type=\"component\" data-label=\"adventure game scripts\">adventure game scripts</span></p>",
"width": 301.0,
"x": 1880.0,
"y": 4540.0
},
"a70231c1-06f9-40ff-a8ed-8e0e283e2643": {
"assets": {
"cover": {
"id": "9cfd36f5-8981-4bc2-b576-49806f16f7ce"
}
},
"autoHeight": true,
"components": ["2cc43715-13b0-4cad-92d7-5b4f61fe66a7"],
"content": "<p>I hate locked doors.</p>",
"height": 288.0,
"outputs": ["1e403494-1ef6-4a1d-b867-c56097a262e6"],
"theme": "default",
"title": "<p>I hate locked doors.</p>",
"width": 301.0,
"x": 6260.0,
"y": 6520.0
},
"a7cf23eb-f245-44a4-b10b-119bf3ebfe8e": {
"assets": {
"cover": {
"id": "9cfd36f5-8981-4bc2-b576-49806f16f7ce"
}
},
"autoHeight": true,
"components": ["2d1e3aaa-d1a3-4565-a540-c0fb9853e2cf"],
"content": "<p>It's your room, next door, right?</p>",
"height": 283.0,
"outputs": ["9a2cb8f7-8118-4ae4-ba31-58ef079d93be"],
"theme": "default",
"title": null,
"width": 301.0,
