}
},
"components": ["2d1e3aaa-d1a3-4565-a540-c0fb9853e2cf"],
"content": "<p>You really need to let go of this notion.</p><pre><code>regrets -= 1</code></pre>",
"height": 383.0,
"outputs": ["90734b43-0c8d-4359-a0af-58ec83b7ef0e"],
"theme": "default",
"title": "<p>You need to let go (<span class=\"mention mention-component\" data-id=\"d95da3c0-0c71-47bd-9d40-d909dbfaaeef\" data-type=\"component\" data-label=\"Amstrad 6128\">Amstrad 6128</span>)</p>",
"width": 301.0,
"x": 8160.0,
"y": 2940.0
},
"a8091c7d-59f8-4627-b819-467f2caf2dfa": {
"assets": {
"cover": {
"id": "9cfd36f5-8981-4bc2-b576-49806f16f7ce"
}
},
"autoHeight": true,
"components": ["2d1e3aaa-d1a3-4565-a540-c0fb9853e2cf"],
"content": "<p>And? What would you have done with it, today?</p>",
"height": 304.0,
"outputs": ["4561f09a-4372-4062-b763-2ba4fb9accc5", "d66f0e3b-1544-436b-96d4-09c1f4f274a1", "b12bc106-fef4-4d03-be9b-847612dfefcc"],
"theme": "default",
"title": "<p>So what if first computer?</p>",
"width": 301.0,
"x": 6260.0,
"y": 3060.0
},
"a81acbb4-af69-4fea-9b78-07e03e1bd49b": {
"assets": {
"cover": {
"id": "f8fd7f52-302d-46df-bff4-f2d3220726a9"
}
},
"components": ["2cc43715-13b0-4cad-92d7-5b4f61fe66a7"],
"content": "<p>I hope your game turns out better than this one.</p>",
"height": 401.0,
"outputs": ["ed758ccd-02de-44c2-8966-03358aca8aeb"],
"theme": "default",
"title": null,
"width": 301.0,
"x": 2800.0,
"y": 3180.0
},
