}
},
"autoHeight": true,
"components": ["2cc43715-13b0-4cad-92d7-5b4f61fe66a7", "f5297f72-36ac-4047-8236-dd23d1da3de3"],
"content": "<p>Let's click on it with the MOUSE and then choose the MAGNIFYING GLASS icon, shall we?</p>",
