"id": "9cfd36f5-8981-4bc2-b576-49806f16f7ce"
}
},
"components": ["2cc43715-13b0-4cad-92d7-5b4f61fe66a7"],
"content": "<p>OK, I'm off!</p>",
"height": 301.0,
"outputs": ["716f6b01-e45a-4ab4-b636-66a4478e8aef"],
"theme": "default",
"title": "<p>OK, I'm off!</p>",
"width": 301.0,
"x": 3080.0,
"y": 4240.0
},
"e3794f69-a29c-45c1-9d1b-416134a74ee1": {
"autoHeight": true,
"components": ["2cc43715-13b0-4cad-92d7-5b4f61fe66a7"],
"content": "<p>I'll leave it where it is.</p>",
"height": 181.0,
"outputs": ["85923094-4884-4352-bbe9-df91dc610df1"],
"theme": "default",
"title": null,
"width": 301.0,
"x": 12500.0,
"y": 11260.0
},
"e4240ba9-66fc-4cbb-b680-78c788ede48c": {
"assets": {
"cover": {
"id": "9cfd36f5-8981-4bc2-b576-49806f16f7ce"
}
},
"autoHeight": true,
"components": ["2cc43715-13b0-4cad-92d7-5b4f61fe66a7"],
"content": "<p>I didn't know that.</p>",
"height": 284.0,
"outputs": ["7dcb4d8a-b3b7-43d8-9914-45602529e1c4"],
"theme": "default",
"title": "<p>I didn't know that.</p>",
"width": 301.0,
"x": 3820.0,
"y": 8820.0
},
"e519d5d2-d50d-464b-9283-84524bbf083c": {
"assets": {
"cover": {
"id": "021fa9d6-8342-475a-b53a-9a465de67a25"
}
},
"autoHeight": false,
"components": [],
"content": "<p>You see:</p><pre><code>if i_amstrad == 1</code></pre><blockquote><p><br><strong><span class=\"mention mention-component\" data-id=\"d95da3c0-0c71-47bd-9d40-d909dbfaaeef\" data-type=\"component\" data-label=\"Amstrad 6128\">Amstrad 6128</span></strong></p></blockquote><pre><code>endif</code></pre><pre><code>if i_magazines == 1</code></pre><blockquote><p><br><strong><span class=\"mention mention-component\" data-id=\"a4412312-b5d7-4826-8335-b51291c6e817\" data-type=\"component\" data-label=\"games magazines\">games magazines</span></strong></p></blockquote><pre><code>endif</code></pre><pre><code>if i_gameScripts == 1</code></pre><blockquote><p><br><strong><span class=\"mention mention-component\" data-id=\"033582a9-c2ea-4fb5-97d9-f252d1303850\" data-type=\"component\" data-label=\"adventure game scripts\">adventure game scripts</span></strong></p></blockquote><pre><code>endif</code></pre><p></p><p>Exits:</p><blockquote><p><strong>exit to Green Room<br><span class=\"mention mention-component\" data-id=\"74a88987-534b-44c6-8434-22ea6de90349\" data-type=\"component\" data-label=\"final exit\">final exit</span></strong></p></blockquote>",
"height": 901.0,
"outputs": ["f478dceb-9ce4-4df6-be80-9ae6e007de48", "274a4c79-40cf-469c-bf54-c3cd219417ae", "ecd19ac5-f372-431d-97cb-5b15a105e9ed", "caf33da1-5c40-43c5-b370-0fbc880d3b56", "ad91bfc3-dae4-4be3-a43c-2fe795fa2f24"],
"theme": "blue",
"title": "<p>Bedroom</p>",
"width": 421.0,
"x": 10320.0,
"y": 9760.0
},
"e6586366-8957-45f9-81af-76fbc6eef241": {
"autoHeight": true,
"components": ["ef85094c-2389-4ee6-9f5c-051aea3a64a1", "a4412312-b5d7-4826-8335-b51291c6e817"],
"content": null,
"height": 181.0,
"outputs": ["72a38b01-421e-48a0-9dfa-36801fb370f9"],
"theme": "cyan",
"title": "<p><span class=\"mention mention-component\" data-id=\"ef85094c-2389-4ee6-9f5c-051aea3a64a1\" data-type=\"component\" data-label=\"handle\">handle</span> <span class=\"mention mention-component\" data-id=\"a4412312-b5d7-4826-8335-b51291c6e817\" data-type=\"component\" data-label=\"games magazines\">games magazines</span> </p>",
"width": 301.0,
"x": 10300.0,
"y": 10620.0
},
"e6d68ec0-799e-4e1b-ad53-fa01b0210c72": {
"assets": {
"cover": {
"id": "9cfd36f5-8981-4bc2-b576-49806f16f7ce"
}
},
"autoHeight": true,
"components": ["2d1e3aaa-d1a3-4565-a540-c0fb9853e2cf"],
"content": "<p>I suppose that was good enough a reason to move on from it.</p>",
"height": 303.0,
"outputs": ["2859d157-c0ed-4203-a10c-7ea7cd1a05e7"],
"theme": "default",
"title": null,
"width": 301.0,
"x": 5520.0,
"y": 3060.0
},
"e781a027-d7ac-4c66-838b-80d607307827": {
"assets": {
"cover": {
"id": "9cfd36f5-8981-4bc2-b576-49806f16f7ce"
}
},
"autoHeight": true,
"components": ["2cc43715-13b0-4cad-92d7-5b4f61fe66a7"],
"content": "<p>When I got into university, I decided to get serious. Use computers for serious causes.</p>",
"height": 324.0,
"outputs": ["4edff36b-e7c4-4549-9e29-6c0cc43bb975"],
"theme": "default",
"title": null,
"width": 301.0,
"x": 4860.0,
"y": 5240.0
},
"e8648409-9d4c-45b1-9de3-17223a3cfe9b": {
"assets": {
"cover": {
"id": "9cfd36f5-8981-4bc2-b576-49806f16f7ce"
}
},
"autoHeight": true,
"components": ["2d1e3aaa-d1a3-4565-a540-c0fb9853e2cf"],
"content": "<p>You have to take responsibility.</p>",
"height": 283.0,
"outputs": ["5a34229c-1015-4bd0-a302-836d1d64e037"],
"theme": "default",
"title": null,
"width": 301.0,
"x": 5240.0,
"y": 5620.0
},
"e8d9653b-16fe-4c5d-9b54-2d33a026426d": {
"assets": {
"cover": {
"id": "9cfd36f5-8981-4bc2-b576-49806f16f7ce"
}
},
"autoHeight": true,
"components": ["2d1e3aaa-d1a3-4565-a540-c0fb9853e2cf"],
"content": "<pre><code>if andreasRoll == playerRoll</code></pre><p>It's a draw.</p><pre><code>else</code></pre><pre><code>show(max(andreasRoll, playerRoll), \" \")</code></pre><p>wins and</p><pre><code>show(min(andreasRoll, playerRoll), \" \")</code></pre><p>loses.</p><pre><code>endif</code></pre>",
"height": 632.0,
"outputs": ["cd1b43e2-c74c-43a5-a645-afdf90367fd9"],
"theme": "default",
"title": null,
"width": 421.0,
"x": 8240.0,
"y": 4240.0
},
"ea8c21fb-8f04-4bdc-a557-3b50085b6f6d": {
"assets": {
"cover": {
"id": "021fa9d6-8342-475a-b53a-9a465de67a25"
}
},
"autoHeight": true,
"components": ["2cc43715-13b0-4cad-92d7-5b4f61fe66a7"],
"content": "<p>It took me 30 years to go beyond that belief and become a game writer.</p>",
"height": 303.0,
"outputs": ["118d75bc-583c-4125-a58d-4e3df08c6a8c"],
"theme": "default",
"title": null,
"width": 301.0,
"x": 3620.0,
"y": 3900.0
},
"ea9a3ad2-50d7-4b1d-95b7-82860b60312a": {
"assets": {
"cover": {
"id": "9cfd36f5-8981-4bc2-b576-49806f16f7ce"
}
},
"autoHeight": true,
"components": ["2d1e3aaa-d1a3-4565-a540-c0fb9853e2cf"],
"content": "<p>You need to let go of</p><pre><code>if regrets <= 2</code></pre><p>this, too.</p><pre><code>else</code></pre><p>this.</p><pre><code>endif</code></pre><pre><code>regrets -= 1</code></pre>",
"height": 569.0,
"outputs": ["de72b54e-0f6e-47db-b848-fdacad3e7e57"],
"theme": "default",
"title": "<p>Let go (<span class=\"mention mention-component\" data-id=\"a4412312-b5d7-4826-8335-b51291c6e817\" data-type=\"component\" data-label=\"games magazines\">games magazines</span>)</p>",
"width": 301.0,
"x": 6820.0,
"y": 5140.0
},
"eb457221-30cd-44dc-97c6-45f212dbfda1": {
"assets": {
"cover": {
"id": "9cfd36f5-8981-4bc2-b576-49806f16f7ce"
}
},
"autoHeight": true,
"components": ["2d1e3aaa-d1a3-4565-a540-c0fb9853e2cf"],
"content": "<p>Looks like a point and click adventure game to me.</p>",
"height": 303.0,
"outputs": ["73cb697d-616d-4d23-85a0-080276b19225"],
"theme": "default",
"title": null,
"width": 301.0,
"x": 5720.0,
"y": 6980.0
},
"eb9940b5-d074-4bba-b6b8-8b6b287acc80": {
"assets": {
"cover": {
"id": "9cfd36f5-8981-4bc2-b576-49806f16f7ce"
}
},
"autoHeight": false,
"components": ["2cc43715-13b0-4cad-92d7-5b4f61fe66a7"],
"content": "<pre><code>if t_andreasBottleneck < 3</code></pre><pre><code>t_andreasBottleneck = 3</code></pre><pre><code>endif</code></pre>",
"height": 441.0,
"outputs": ["97f0a4d4-d37f-4b87-908f-bf32a444ecb8", "1b9827a1-4059-46ed-b165-986bd9559d84", "c28fe67d-d075-426a-b056-d41a58dfcdd2", "07fedeb1-245d-4b39-b8d3-f13126102984"],
"theme": "pink",
"title": "<p>bottleneck_3</p>",
"width": 301.0,
"x": 3580.0,
"y": 8420.0
},
"eba9249c-5c40-4b60-ac19-efb24c3da118": {
"autoHeight": true,
"components": ["2cc43715-13b0-4cad-92d7-5b4f61fe66a7", "f5297f72-36ac-4047-8236-dd23d1da3de3"],
"content": "<p>This one has my mum's writing.</p>",
"height": 181.0,
"outputs": [],
"theme": "default",
"title": null,
"width": 301.0,
"x": 15360.0,
"y": 10740.0
},
